40: /**
41:  * Automatically creates a structure definition based on the references found by the decompiler.
42:  *
43:  * If the parameter is already a structure pointer, any new references found will be added
44:  * to the structure, even if the structure must grow.
45:  *
46:  */
47: public class FillOutStructureCmd extends BackgroundCommand {
